    "pf-068fe21a": {
      "type": "pf-068fe21a",
      "settings": {
        "pf_194a356b_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <a href=\"/pages/support-center\" target=\"_self\">Support Center</a> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_82fe63a6_value": "For computers (Mac or PC):<br>ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br>For phones (Android or iOS):<br>ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started.",
        "pf_d6d10820_value": "ThePhotoStick&nbsp;Omni is a versatile storage solution that securely backs up photos, videos, and files from ALL of your devices, including Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android tablets and smartphones. <br><br>Offering 256GB of storage, ThePhotoStick Omni&nbsp;allows you to back up over 102,000 of your favorite photos and videos. Download the FREE app from the Google Play or Apple App Store to experience seamless organization, preservation, and sharing of your cherished moments.",
        "pf_fb6fc7d0_value": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page. ",
        "pf_f48c0ebb_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni, check out our Official User Guide.</em>",
        "pf_6728e1fe_value": "This depends on how many photos and videos you have.<br><br>- The 128GB version can hold up to 51,200 photos and videos, which will be plenty for most people.<br><br>- The 256GB version holds up to roughly 102,400 photos and videos, giving you all the storage you'll ever need, perfect for large families with lots of memories.",
        "pf_106eb374_value": "Had tried numerous times coping from the iPhone to windows laptop and the darn interface woul d fail and never complete the copy. I think it done on purpose by Apple so you end up using a Mac. Bought the photo stick and it did a great job coping all 2500 photos and over 400 videos.&nbsp;A 1000 thank you !!",
        "pf_16e8e5b8_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni works with all modern computers, smartphones, tablets, and computers right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and newer<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and later",
        "pf_1f06334e_value": "Great product.. even greater customer serviceVery good customer service: I had a problem with the original order… the Omni would not stay securely in my phone. The customer service dept was very helpful and understanding. They sent me a new one (very quickly,too) and it worked perfectly.",
        "pf_18ae6db2_value": "Of course!&nbsp;Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST<br>",
        "pf_043292ff_value": "We are dedicated to ensuring that every customer of ThePhotoStick Omni is delighted. We're so confident that you'll love it that we offer a no-risk 30-day Money-Back Guarantee from the day of delivery.",
        "pf_efcaf42a_value": "ThePhotoStick Omni is the original, trusted solution for effortlessly backing up and organizing your photos and videos. Don't be fooled by knock-offs; choose the trusted name in memory management.",
        "pf_c534370a_value": "This is a great solution for those thousands of pictures that you save in your phone. It is a true game changer to let you protect those valuables memories.",
        "pf_1a535c13_value": "It's so easy to use, I'm in my late 60s so I'm not too savvy with this kinda stuff but this was so easy even I can use it by myself. Nice product.",
        "pf_2e602346_value": "No complicated software installation. Just plug the adapter into your device and get started.",
        "pf_a79b1cad_value": "Securely back up each file and organize them neatly into folders so they're easy to find.",
        "pf_c2c9ba05_value": "Easily store your precious photo and video memories, no matter where they are. ",
